  "De-ice mode runs for the time set in parameter 75.03; write 0 to BV 11 before writing 1 again to restart it.",
  "Run/stop and speed reference can't be split between hardwire and BACnet on this firmware.",
  "Heatsink-Temperature is a percentage of the fault limit, not degrees."
