  "enable": "A jumper from +24 VDC to DI2 must be in place for BACnet run/stop and speed commands; set the functions to EFB (embedded fieldbus) in the startup assistant (76.03 run/stop, 75.01 de-ice, 74.01 trickle heating).",
  "heartbeat": null,
  "remote_sensors": null,
  "setup": [
   "Unlock group 58 with code 13 in parameter 96.02, then set 58.01 = Modbus RTU, 58.03 = 1, 58.04 = 19.2 kbps, 58.05 = 8 None 1 and power-cycle the drive.",
   "Choose profile 3 (ACS880-CTDD) in the ProtoNode web configurator.",
   "ProtoNode default IP address 192.168.1.24, subnet 255.255.255.0; it serves BACnet IP or BACnet MS/TP."
  ],
  "gotchas": [
   "De-ice and trickle heating can be used over BACnet even when run/stop and speed are hardwired.",
   "To restart de-ice, write 0 to BV 11 and then 1."
  ]
 },
